    "final_answer": "I found a recipe that meets all the criteria. Here are the details:\n\n## Recipe Found: **Easy Moist Chocolate Cupcakes**\n\n**Source:** https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/17481/easy-moist-chocolate-cupcakes/ (found via search on Allrecipes)\n\n### Key Details:\n- ⭐ **Rating:** 4.7 stars\n- 💬 **Reviews:** 957 Reviews (well exceeds the 100+ requirement)\n- 📊 **Ratings:** 1,219 Ratings\n- ⏱️ **Prep Time:** 15 mins\n- ⏱️ **Cook Time:** 15 mins\n- ⏱️ **Total Time:** 30 mins ✅ (well under 1 hour)\n- 🍴 **Yield:** 16 cupcakes\n\n### Description:\nThis chocolate cupcake recipe makes rich, moist, and tender cupcakes from scratch with cocoa powder and easy baking ingredients. The recipe recommends frosting with chocolate buttercream for the ultimate chocolaty treat — perfect for birthdays and holiday parties.\n\n### Why This Recipe Meets Your Criteria:\n1. ✅ **Preparation time under 1 hour:** Total time is only 30 minutes (15 mins prep + 15 mins cook)\n2. ✅ **At least 100 user reviews:** Has 957 reviews (and 1,219 ratings total)\n\nThis is an ideal choice — it's one of Allrecipes' most popular and well-reviewed chocolate cupcake recipes, tested by the Allrecipes Test Kitchen and submitted by Ladan M Miller.",
